      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After a long day, Vika is in a lousy mood, and Max takes her to a bar to cheer her up. There they meet his friends Kostya and Nastya, which is a little awkward, since Vika is their boss at Claude Monet. Here are the introductions in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Настроение паршивое.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
